<title>JAPAN: Glory Ltd - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Glory Ltd - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 31.20		vs	   40.67</p>
<p> Operating	    1.09		vs	    3.93</p>
<p> Current		1.21		vs	    3.89</p>
